{"ratings":[{"id":"F1","consequence":"boundary","trigger":"plausible","reason":"A previously supported trailing-slash glob no longer protects matching files, allowing an agent’s edits to cross the configured protected-path boundary."},{"id":"F2","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"plausible","reason":"A docs-only change can silently skip another required test suite when it shares a compound command with Bun tests, causing failures to be missed."},{"id":"F3","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"plausible","reason":"A slow transient post-merge targeted failure misses the automatic retry and unnecessarily stops the run for human intervention."}]}